# Written by update-generated-code-analyzer-config.ps1; do not edit by hand. Run the script after changing the SDK in
# global.json or an analyzer package; CI runs it with -Check.
#
# The analyzers listed here analyse generated code, so they execute on every source generator tree, where an
# .editorconfig section cannot reach them (csc gives generator trees no per-tree options). Setting each of their
# diagnostics to none here makes the analyzer driver skip the analyzer on every tree that has no per-tree severity of
# its own, which is exactly the generator trees; the generated region of the root .editorconfig restores the
# severities for files on disk. Analyzers that opt out of generated code are already skipped there and need nothing.
is_global = true

